WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.706 --> 00:00:06.737
1. Open Team access from your account menu.

2
00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:12.868
2. Enter your teammate’s email address.

3
00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:18.701
3. Choose an access level, such as Developer or Billing only.

4
00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:27.387
4. Send the invite. You can change or remove their access at any time.
